commit 9cafb979b8
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 14 06:38:28 2026 +1000

    RBM: Bound object nesting and fix NULL strings and struct names

    Nested objects were bounded only by increment_dissection_depth(), which
    ends in a DISSECTOR_ASSERT at the limit. Nesting is now limited to 64
    levels per packet (kept with p_get_proto_depth()) and deeper objects get
