    STUN: Bound nesting through DATA and ChannelData, fix password algs

    The DATA attribute and ChannelData payloads go to the "stun" heuristic
    list, which contains STUN itself when the stun_turn heuristic is
    enabled. Nested DATA indications recursed until the layer limit
    DISSECTOR_ASSERT fired. Allow at most 4 levels of STUN inside STUN,
