commit e9669aec39
Author: John Thacker <johnthacker@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 22:12:15 2026 -0500

    GQUIC: Encoding is not a bool

    The Wireshark encoding parmeter is an unsigned, not a bool. However,
    to be extra careful and avoid changing a struct type in a exported header
    (even though the only function using that type does not have public
    visibility), map true and false to ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN and ENC_BIG_ENDIAN,
    respectively, unlike on master and the unrelease 5.0, where we can make
    the correct fix.

    This fixes dissection of the ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN case and a MSVC C4305 in
    the latest versions of MSVC.

