commit b6b85406b1
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 12:20:28 2026 +1000

    SOCKS: Do not re-enter the UDP dissector for the payload

    A SOCKS5 UDP datagram whose DST.PORT equals the relay port made the
