commit 3136efa53b
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 05:03:02 2026 +1000

    SIMULCRYPT: Bound ECM_group nesting and the ECM datagram length

    An EIS ECM_group parameter is dissected by calling
