commit a756a6faec
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 13 13:32:44 2026 +1000

    X509IF: Bound recursion and DN string building

    Refinement, ContextCombination and AttributeCombination recurse through
    "not", "and" and "or" and were bounded only by the dissection depth
    counter, which ends in a DISSECTOR_ASSERT. A certificate extension with
    OID 2.5.18.6 and a few hundred nested "not" values aborted. Stop 16
    levels before the tree depth limit with an expert info.

    Building the DN string copied the whole DN for every RDN and
    registered the frame end routine for every RDN, RDNSequence and AVA,
    which made memory and CPU quadratic in the number of RDNs. Stop
    prepending once the DN string is 1024 bytes long and register the
    frame end routine once per frame.

    Also reset ava_hf_index at the end of the frame, so that an exception
    inside an AVA does not leave a stale format for later frames.

