commit d921adde3d
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 13 13:32:44 2026 +1000

    WSMP: Use an unsigned offset in the legacy element loop

    The offset was a uint16_t, so in a frame longer than 64 KB without a
    terminating element it wrapped to 0 before reaching the end of the
    tvb, and the loop never ended. Use an unsigned offset so the tvb
    bounds exception ends the loop.

