commit 0698cf0c24
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 14:36:49 2026 +1000

    reassemble: Find the next fragment number from the first gap

    fragment_add_seq_next() and the other REASSEMBLE_FLAGS_NO_FRAG_NUMBER
    users walked the whole fragment list for every new fragment to find
    the next fragment number, so a long sequence was quadratic. A USB-MIDI
    SysEx message that never ends, 3 bytes per fragment, took 25 seconds
    for a 165 KB capture. Start the walk at first_gap, the last fragment
