commit ed8019ca00
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 06:57:17 2026 +1000

    ZigBee Direct: Bound the session key ring and fix key checks

    Every Dump Info notification carrying a session key added a key to
    the key ring, and every later encrypted packet tried every key twice,
    so a capture with N keys and M encrypted packets cost N x M x 2 AES-CCM
    operations (8000 x 8000 took 87 seconds). Skip a key that is already in
