commit 107bda3e77
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 07:27:31 2026 +1000

    YAMI: Bound nested parameters and check the message header size

    Nested parameters recurse with only increment_dissection_depth(),
    which asserts at the tree depth limit. At 12 bytes per level, a
    parameter nested 600 deep (7.2 KB, reachable through an Exported PDU
    naming "yami") ended in a dissector bug and aborted under
