    extension, and it is walked for every DTLS record. Add a session only
    once (flag in SslSession).

    The JA4 cipher and extension lists were built with
    wmem_list_insert_sorted(), which is quadratic. Append to arrays and
    sort once.

    Also bound the supported_groups and ech_outer_extensions loops by the
    vector end, limit ECHConfig contents to the ECHConfig length, loop over
    the CertificateURL list by byte length, use ENC_NA for the cert types
    item, and set alpn_name and the ALPN app handle on the first pass only.

