commit b11c7148c6
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 12:20:29 2026 +1000

    TCP: Fix NULL dereferences and asserts in option and analysis code

    The TCP option dissectors in the "tcp.option" table assume they are
    called from tcp_dissect_options() with a struct tcpheader and an
    existing TCP conversation. An Exported PDU record naming that table
    passes NULL data and may have no conversation, so the SACK-permitted,
    MSS, TFO, MPTCP and SNACK dissectors dereferenced a NULL pointer, and
    the MSS, window scale, SACK, SCPS and SNACK dissectors looked up the
