    missing and tolerate a missing conversation.

    The SCPS extended capabilities loop used an 8-bit offset that wrapped
    for options longer than 255 bytes, so it never ended. Use wider types.

    Replace the DISSECTOR_ASSERT in the MPTCP mapping lookup, which fails
    when a DSS mapping starts inside the segment, with the missing-mapping
    expert info. Skip checksum verification, instead of asserting, when the
    address type is not IPv4, IPv6 or ILNP. Cap the number of duplicate
    frames listed in the tree, which was quadratic in the size of the
    group.

    The SNACK option read the ACK number at offset 8 of the 6-byte option,
    which threw on every valid option; take it from the TCP header. Pass
    true as more_frags to fragment_add_out_of_order() instead of a
    sequence number.

