commit ddfd1bad24
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 12:20:28 2026 +1000

    SPICE: Reject wrapping message lengths

    A server message size close to 4G wrapped the PDU length (size plus
