commit eaa045767c
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 05:03:01 2026 +1000

    S7COMM: Bound recursion through nested TIS replace jobs

    A TIS "Replace job" request carries a job subfunction taken from the
    packet. If it is Replace job again, s7comm_decode_ud_tis_jobs() and
    s7comm_decode_ud_tis_data() call each other once per 8 bytes of data,
    without any limit. COTP and S7COMM reassembly make arbitrarily large
    PDUs possible, so a crafted packet overflowed the stack. Count the
