commit b449a72e66
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 20:26:01 2026 +1000

    QuakeWorld: Fix quadratic allocation in the command tokenizer

    COM_Parse() allocated a buffer for all the text remaining in the packet
    for every token, and Cmd_TokenizeString() kept tokenizing after the
    80 arguments it can store. A 64 kB connectionless packet of one
    character tokens allocated about 1 GB from the packet pool. Stop at
