    rest of the text after the token, instead of the token, so the client
    to server commands were never recognized. COM_Parse() now returns the
    token through an out parameter and that is stored. An unterminated
    quoted token no longer moves the pointer beyond the terminating NUL.

    The length of the connect arguments item included one byte more than
    the string, past its end. Use len - start.

