    QNET6: Bound the nesting of combined messages

    Every _IO_* message handler in the KIF MsgSend dissector calls
    dissect_qnet6_kif_msgsend_msg() again when the combine length has
    bit 0x8000 set. A message of only 4 bytes per level (_IO_CLOSE with
