commit 4ae113fdd2
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 20:26:00 2026 +1000

    RPCoRDMA: Do not use stale InfiniBand/iWARP info and fix a tvb leak

    The file-scope pointers to the InfiniBand and iWARP info structures
    point into the callers' stack frames and were never cleared. When
    dissect_rpcrdma() was reached through the registered "rpcordma"
    handle (Decode As, Exported PDU), it used the pointers left from a
