commit 860d2e8cb5
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 15:16:33 2026 +1000

    PROXY: Bound nested PROXY headers, end SSL sub-TLVs at the TLV end

    The payload after a PROXY v2 header can be another PROXY header, which
    re-enters the PROXY dissector through the TCP or UDP heuristic tables
    with no limit of its own. Count the nesting per packet and stop with an
