commit 82889e8ef8
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 6 12:37:09 2026 +1000

    InfiniBand: Fix uninitialized read and multi-pass state in CM and RC send

    The connection context saved when a CM REQ is seen was allocated
    without being cleared. For an IPv4 REQ only four bytes of each GID were
