commit c1690afd59
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 17:39:51 2026 +1000

    GTP: Fix NULL conversation dereference and uninitialized PDCP data

    An End User Address of PDP type 0x8d (IPv4v6) with length 18 added its
    dynamic IPv4 placeholder to the IPv6 field, a field type error that is
    reported as a dissector bug (and aborts with
