commit 631ef981b7
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 17:39:51 2026 +1000

    GTPv2: Bound grouped IE nesting and fix NULL dereferences

    Grouped IEs call dissect_gtpv2_ie_common() recursively with no limit,
    so a datagram of nested grouped IEs exhausted the stack or hit the tree
    depth error. Limit the nesting with a per-packet depth counter, and
    stop with an expert info before the generic dissection depth limit.

    The IMSI and Cause decoders wrote to args when session tracking was on
    even though callers such as the JSON 3GPP dissector pass NULL. Check
    args first.

