commit eeda1ebd42
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 3 16:52:53 2026 +1000

    E2AP: Fix NULL tvb on TNL address and RAN function dissector choice

    An extended tnlAddress BIT STRING of length 0 gives a NULL value tvb,
    which was passed to tvb_captured_length() and failed an assertion.
    Check for a NULL tvb, show an IPv6 address only for a 16-byte address,
    show both addresses for a 20-byte IPv4 plus IPv6 address, and nothing
    for other lengths.

    When a RAN function name was stored, the initial service model
