commit 39b3e55a3a
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 7 19:03:58 2026 +1000

    LTP: Fix assert on large client service IDs and header offsets

    A data segment with a client service ID that does not fit in 32 bits
    hit DISSECTOR_ASSERT(client_service_id < UINT32_MAX) and aborted the
    dissection. Such IDs now skip the dissector table lookup and fall
    through to the data dissector.

