commit d13819323d
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 6 19:55:21 2026 +1000

    ITS: Fix DSRC imports and bit offsets in ItsPduHeader

    CPM-PDU-Descriptionsv1.asn and ISO19321IVIv2.asn imported LaneID,
    NodeOffsetPointXY and Offset-B10..B16 from a module called DSRC, but
    the module in DSRC.asn is ETSI-ITS-DSRC. asn2wrs could not resolve the
