commit 9a7486d0cd
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 4 16:22:14 2026 +1000

    fcswils: Fix nested zone set handling and small errors

    A ZONESET zone object was dissected recursively for its members, limited
    only by the dissection depth, which ends in a dissector assertion at
    the maximum tree depth for a few hundred nested objects. The format
    nests a zone set only once, which is also all get_zoneobj_len() accounts
