commit afacb4c25e
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 30 10:21:05 2026 +1000

    BT LE: Do not use an uninitialized advertiser address, fix fields

    An extended advertising PDU without AdvA and without a known connection
    never set the source address buffer, but it was still passed to the
    AD dissector. A BIGInfo AD copied it into the file-scope broadcast ISO
    state, from where it was shown as the Central Address of the BIS PDUs
    and used as their source address. Zero the buffers.

    The extended advertising Host Advertising Data fragments were shown,
    and the reassembled data dissected, only when a packet was visited
    again, so a single pass decoded the fragments as complete Advertising
