    is too short for its fields, read the LL_PERIODIC_SYNC_IND Sleep Clock
    Accuracy from the PDU instead of from the channel map offset, give the
    "Anonymous" address its full length and flag an overlapping control
    procedure on the first pass as well.

    LL_PHY_UPDATE_IND without a PHY change has no Instant, but the
    uninitialized instant variable was still stored with the control
