commit 77526a1a07
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 17:33:58 2026 +1000

    SCCP: Check that the destination is a point code before using it

    dissect_sccp() checked only that the source address was an SS7 point
    code and then read the destination address data as an mtp3_addr_pc_t
    too. A carrier that sets only the source, such as PPCAP with a Source
