commit f3577c4189
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 15:16:32 2026 +1000

    PER: Use the 64-bit API for wide integer fields in dissect_per_integer

    dissect_per_integer() accepted any FT_INT* or FT_UINT* field but always
