commit 34499e9f02
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 15:16:32 2026 +1000

    PPP: Bound nesting of PPP payloads and fix small decoding errors

    LCP Protocol-Reject, PPPMux sub-frames and Multilink single-fragment
    reassembly each hand packet-controlled data back to the PPP protocol
    table or to dissect_ppp() with no limit, so a crafted packet nests until
    the generic layer-depth assertion fires. Add a per-packet nesting
    counter (limit 8) kept with p_get_proto_depth(), with an expert info and
