commit ea42ce1b60
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 7 12:30:40 2026 +1000

    LLDP: Fix TLV length handling in several TLVs

    The Time To Live TLV returned a fixed length and ignored the TLV
    length, so a TLV with a length other than 2 desynchronised the
    dissection of the following TLVs. Return the TLV length instead.

    A management address with an address string length of 0 made the
