commit d4a9aa5444
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 8 18:54:24 2026 +1000

    NR RRC: Bound nested RRCReconfiguration and fix a PDU field type

    RRCReconfiguration and RRCReconfigurationComplete can contain
