commit 862cc3ce44
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 8 16:41:43 2026 -0500

    SVCCTL: Keep EnumServicesStatusW names in their buffer

    The service and display names of an EnumServicesStatusW response are at
