    their children at every nesting level, and the and/or accumulators were
    rebuilt per item. Truncate the strings that feed Filter_string to
    ITEM_LABEL_LENGTH before wrapping them, without cutting a UTF-8
    character in two, and stop growing the and/or accumulators past that
    length.

    Deeply nested filters reached the DISSECTOR_ASSERT of the dissection
    depth limit (about 200 nested not filters). Stop with an expert info
    16 levels before that limit.

    A Credentials value of zero length (04 00) made get_ber_identifier()
    throw; return early instead. DirSyncFlags read the BER length at the
    identifier offset instead of after the identifier; use the offsets
    returned by the BER helpers. dissect_NetLogon_PDU() kept an unsigned
    length in a uint16_t; use unsigned.

