commit acd3265cc5
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 6 19:55:21 2026 +1000

    KINK: Bound the payload chain recursion

    control_payload() calls the handler of each payload, and every handler
    calls control_payload() again for the next payload. Nothing limited the
    depth, so a packet with a long chain of tiny payloads overflowed the
    stack.

