commit 007fa5fedb
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 17:39:51 2026 +1000

    GSM CBSP: Fix a NULL dereference for unsupported coding schemes

    dissect_cbs_data() returns NULL for a data coding scheme it does not
