commit 6f28b7e3ce
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 17:39:50 2026 +1000

    GQUIC: Do not assert on CRYPTO frames in older versions

    A CRYPTO frame (0x08) in a packet whose version is not known or is
    below Q050 hit DISSECTOR_ASSERT(version_valid && version >= 50). That
    is reachable with one crafted UDP packet. Report an expert info and
    skip the rest of the packet instead.

    Also fix a few tag parsing errors: the CADR unknown address type
    advanced tag_offset by tag_len + 4 instead of tag_len - 4, a PUBS tag
    shorter than 2 bytes made the end-offset arithmetic wrap, and the
