commit 405c38e8f4
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 4 13:47:44 2026 +1000

    Ethertype: Limit the nesting of encapsulated payloads

    Ethernet in Ethernet (0x6558), E-Tag, EtherIP and similar encapsulations
    all re-enter dissect_ethertype(). Deeply nested packets ran into the
    DISSECTOR_ASSERT on the layer limit in epan/packet.c, a "Dissector bug"
