commit 63ebe9c33c
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 30 05:43:27 2026 +1000

    BSSGP: Reset the SI item parameters for each item, fix several IE lengths

    The RR message function and subtree of a NACC SI item were set only
