commit 6633b68372
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 26 09:17:28 2026 +1000

    AMQP: Fix a field type assertion and a type confusion in AMQP 1.0

    An AMQP 1.0 list item is dissected by the type its encoding octet
    names, into the field of that list position. A boolean (0x41, 0x42)
    or a timestamp (0x83) sent for a field of another type, such as the
