    - Recognise the 0-9-1 ("AMQP" 0 0 9 1) and 0-8 ("AMQP" 1 1 8 0)
      protocol headers, which use the 0-9 framing.
    - Acknowledge every outstanding message for a multiple ack of
      delivery tag 0.
    - Show the elements of 0-9 field arrays, which were added to a NULL
      item.
    - Name Exchange.Unbind-Ok by its method id, 51.
    - Read 0-10 tx commands from the start of the command, not one octet
      in, so that they are not all shown as tx.select.
    - Step over the size of the 0-10 message.subscribe arguments map
      before its entry count.
    - Give the 0-10 types 0xd0-0xdf and 0xf0-0xff their sizes of 9 and 0
      octets in maps, not 5.
    - Show 1.0 message and correlation ids sent as ulong in 64-bit fields.
    - Add the "unknown list type" expert info of 1.0 lists to a tree item
