commit f5b7cf610d
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 3 08:50:17 2026 +1000

    DOP: Reset the binding type for each PDU

    The binding type OID was kept in a file-scope pointer into
    pinfo->pool and never reset, so a later PDU without a binding type
    used a string freed with an earlier packet when it looked up the
    binding parameter dissector and wrote the Info column. Reset it at the
