commit b1206a3854
Author: John Thacker <johnthacker@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 2 09:15:47 2026 -0500

    COROSYNC/TOTEMNET: Forget the last key when the keys change

    The index of the key that decrypted the last packet was a static
