commit d17f061b5c
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 30 16:39:54 2026 +1000

    CDT: Do not use the tree of an earlier packet, limit the nesting

    The compressed data dissector kept the tree it was called with in file
