commit f740fe895a
Author: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 26 09:02:52 2026 +1000

    Exported PDU: Only give the TCP information to TCP dissectors

    The TCP information tag of an exported PDU is turned into a struct
    tcpinfo that was passed to whichever dissector the PDU names. A
    dissector reached through the name, heuristic or table tags with a
    data argument of its own type then reads and writes the small tcpinfo
    allocation as that type. AMR, for example, takes it as a struct
    _rtp_info, reads a map pointer from past its end and stores to it, so
    a two tag capture that names "amr" crashes tshark.

    Pass the TCP information only to a dissector that TCP calls: one
    registered in the "tcp.port" table, one of a protocol with a "tcp"
    heuristic dissector (which set conversation dissectors such as
    PROXY's), a heuristic dissector of the "tcp" list, or the "tcp.port"
    table itself. When the tag is missing, give these dissectors empty TCP
    information instead of NULL: several dereference it unconditionally
    (the RTMPT heuristic dissector, for one), and TCP's own export code
    does when PROXY passes it on, so "tshark -U" of such a capture
    crashed. PDUs exported from TCP dissect as before.

    Two more paths ended in an assertion: a dissector table tag naming a
    string table aborted tshark in the uint lookup, and a port type the
    dissector did not map, including iWARP MPA and MCTP, which the export
    code writes itself, failed a DISSECTOR_ASSERT(). Only look up integer
    tables, map those two port types and treat other values as none.

    Check the length of the tags of a fixed size before reading them, so
    that a short tag gives the "Unexpected tag length" warning instead of
    reading the tags after it, and keep the type string of a 3GPP UE ID
    inside its tag.

    4.4 doesn't have the 3GPP UE ID or link direction tags, and its tag
    length is an int.

    Signed-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>
    Assisted-by: Claude
    (backported from commit 656881e3e05e730a992f2d4df35d3fe15836429b)

