commit 36ede88958
Author: John Thacker <johnthacker@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 15 08:26:47 2026 -0400

    vwr: Require the original RF header to be present

    The IxVeriWave RF header has 100 bytes; we only supply 76 of them as
    part of the packet record, skipping over 20 bytes in the middle and
    4 at the end. When checking that the record is long enough to be valid,
    use the expected original length, not the length of what we supply after
    skipping some fields. This prevents accepting short records and filling
    the port fields with uninitialized bytes.

